@TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268

### Reservar un turno (201 Created)
# @name reservar
POST {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "afiliadoId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "profesionalId": "9b2f4c1e-8d3a-4f6b-a1c2-7e5d9f0b3a48",
  "inicio": "2027-03-15T13:00:00Z"
}

### Consultar el turno recién reservado (200 OK)
GET {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos/{{reservar.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancelar el turno recién reservado (204 No Content; si se repite, 422)
POST {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos/{{reservar.response.body.$.id}}/cancelar

### Turno inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Reservar en el pasado (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "afiliadoId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "profesionalId": "9b2f4c1e-8d3a-4f6b-a1c2-7e5d9f0b3a48",
  "inicio": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### Body inválido (400 Bad Request, validación automática de [ApiController])
POST {{TurnosMedicos.Api_HostAddress}}/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "afiliadoId": "no-es-un-guid"
}
